  "title": "http: Fix a problem with a key expiring",
  "description": "The tcpinfo struct is declared on the stack in dissect_tcp. If we need\nto use a member of it (seq) as a key in a map that is declared at file\nscope, just use the integer directly with GUINT_TO_POINTER.\n\nFix #17854 (at least one instance of it; the issue can crop up in a number\nof subtle ways.)\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit cd8dca85a7cf56a975acedd8f845d7e95f91be0f)",
